Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.parallel.render.enable=false|
		|extraapps.plugins.includes|content-targeting|
		|ignore.errors|IX_DC6100CC|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|false|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.component.names|Content Targeting|
		|testray.main.component.name|Content Targeting|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|User Segment Name|
	Then PortletEntry save

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Delete Campaign CP
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	Then ContentTargetingCampaign delete Campaign CP
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
Scenario: Edit Campaign CP
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|New US Description|
		|userSegmentName|New US Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Custom Form CP
		|formAlias|Form Alias|
		|formId|Form id|
		|formTrackingActionSelect|Submit|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Edit Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign view Tracking Actions CP
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|formAlias|Form Alias|
		|formId|Form id|
		|formTrackingActionSelect|Submit|
		|viewTrackingActionsList|Form|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign edit Campaign CP
		|campaignDescriptionEdit|Campaign Description Edit|
		|campaignEndDateEdit|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTimeEdit|12:00 AM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignNameEdit|Campaign Name Edit|
		|campaignPriorityFieldEdit|5|
		|campaignStartDateEdit|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTimeEdit|12:00 PM|
		|userSegmentSelectEdit|New US Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And Navigator goto Nav Tab
		|navTab|Configuration|
	And ContentTargeting enable Analytics
		|analyticsList|YouTube Videos,Link,Link Clicks|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Edit Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name Edit|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign edit Custom Report
		|trackingActionAddList|youtube,link|
		|trackingActionDeleteList|form|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Edit Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name Edit|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	Then ContentTargetingCampaign view Tracking Actions CP
		|campaignName|Campaign Name Edit|
		|linkAlias|Link Alias|
		|linkId|Link id|
		|linkTrackingActionSelect|Click|
		|viewTrackingActionsList|Link,YouTube|
		|youtubeAlias|Youtube Alias|
		|youtubeTrackingActionSelect|Playing|
		|youtubeVideoId|Youtube id|
Scenario: View Inactive Campaign CP
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignInactive|true|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	Then ContentTargetingCampaign view Campaign CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriority|3|
		|campaignStatus|Inactive|